## Implementation

### 1. Cursor model (opaque, self-contained)

```java
public record SearchCursor(String pitId, List<Object> sortValues) {

    private static final ObjectMapper MAPPER = new ObjectMapper();

    public String encode() {
        try {
            byte[] json = MAPPER.writeValueAsBytes(this);
            return Base64.getUrlEncoder().withoutPadding().encodeToString(json);
        } catch (JsonProcessingException e) {
            throw new IllegalStateException("Failed to encode cursor", e);
        }
    }

    public static SearchCursor decode(String encoded) {
        try {
            byte[] json = Base64.getUrlDecoder().decode(encoded);
            return MAPPER.readValue(json, SearchCursor.class);
        } catch (Exception e) {
            throw new InvalidCursorException("Malformed pagination cursor");
        }
    }
}
```

### 2. Response wrapper

```java
public record PagedResult<T>(
        List<T> items,
        String nextCursor,   // null when exhausted
        boolean hasMore
) {}
```

### 3. Request DTO with validation

```java
public record SearchRequest(
        String query,

        @Min(1) @Max(100)
        int pageSize,

        String cursor        // null on first page
) {
    public SearchRequest {
        if (pageSize == 0) pageSize = 20; // sane default
    }
}
