## Client Contract

```
GET /api/v1/products/search?query=laptop&pageSize=20
→ { items: [...], nextCursor: "eyJwaXRJZCI...", hasMore: true }

GET /api/v1/products/search?query=laptop&pageSize=20&cursor=eyJwaXRJZCI...
→ { items: [...], nextCursor: "eyJ...", hasMore: true }

... until hasMore: false, nextCursor: null
```

